      '<div class="inventory-print-warehouse-pick" role="group" aria-label="列印倉庫位置"><strong>列印倉庫位置</strong>' + inventoryPrintWarehouseButtonsHtml(inventoryPrintWarehouseChoice()) + '<em>選哪個倉，標籤就印那個倉的條碼位置。貨還在中國倉也能先印台灣倉。</em></div>',
